@startuml SD_UC_U1_Reservation_Deposit
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Khách hàng" as Guest
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "ReservationController" as Controller
participant "ReservationService" as Service
participant "ReservationRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
participant "VNPAY" as VNPAY

== Tạo đơn đặt bàn & Giữ chỗ tạm thời ==

Guest -> UI: Nhập thông tin \nchọn Set Menu (tùy chọn) & Đặt bàn
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/reservations \n({/PreOrderedSetMenuId})
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CreateReservation(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: LockTable(tableId, 17m) & SaveReservation(dto)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: UPDATE Tables SET Status = 'Hold' \nINSERT Reservations (PreOrderedSetMenuId)
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service: BuildPaymentUrl(dto)
Service --> Controller: paymentUrl
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 201 Created (paymentUrl)
deactivate Controller

UI --> Guest: Hiển thị VietQR thanh toán
deactivate UI

== Xử lý Webhook IPN từ VNPAY ==

Guest -> VNPAY: Quét QR thanh toán cọc
activate VNPAY

VNPAY -> Controller: POST /api/payments/vnpay-ipn
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: ProcessIpn(params)
activate Service

Service -> Service: ValidateSignature(params)

alt Còn trong thời hạn giữ chỗ (<= 17 phút)
    Service -> Repo: ConfirmReservation(id)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE Reservations \n& Tables SET Status = 'Confirmed'
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: OK
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: OK
    deactivate Repo

    Service -> UI: PushSignalR("BookingSuccess")
    activate UI
    UI --> Guest: Đặt bàn thành công
    deactivate UI

else Quá hạn giữ chỗ (> 17 phút) & Bàn đã có người khác
    Service -> VNPAY: RefundRequest(orderId, amount)
    VNPAY --> Service: RefundSuccess (00)
    
    Service -> Repo: CancelReservation()
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE Reservations \nSET Status = 'Refunded'
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: OK
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: OK
    deactivate Repo

    Service -> UI: PushSignalR("BookingFailed_Refunded")
    activate UI
    UI --> Guest: Báo quá hạn \n& Đã hoàn cọc
    deactivate UI
end

Service --> Controller: RspCode: 00
deactivate Service

Controller --> VNPAY: 200 OK (Confirm Success)
deactivate Controller
deactivate VNPAY

@enduml